"If only one viable extension is available, Quarkus assumes this is the "
"correct one.\n"
"When you add a driver to the test scope, Quarkus automatically includes it "
"in testing."
msgstr ""

msgid "JDBC connection pool size adjustment"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To protect your database from overload during load peaks, size the pool "
"appropriately to throttle the database load.\n"
"The optimal pool size depends on many factors, such as the number of "
"parallel application users or the nature of the workload."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Be aware that setting the pool size too low might cause some requests to "
"time out while waiting for a connection."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For more information about pool size adjustment properties, see the <<jdbc-"
"configuration>> section."
msgstr ""

msgid "Read-only JDBC pools"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can mark a JDBC pool as read-only so that connections are created with\n"
"link:https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/"
"Connection.html#setReadOnly(boolean)[`Connection.setReadOnly(true)`].\n"
"The JDBC driver is responsible for enforcing read-only mode."
msgstr ""

msgid "This is useful for secondary pools that target read replicas."
msgstr ""

msgid "For a named datasource:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When the property is unset, Quarkus does not configure read-only mode and "
"Agroal's default applies (connections are not read-only)."
msgstr ""

