"However, they are unlikely to function when compiling your application into "
"a native executable.\n"
"To build a native executable, use an existing Quarkus JDBC extension or "
"contribute a new extension for your driver."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For details about JDBC configuration options and configuring other aspects, "
"such as the connection pool size, refer to the <<jdbc-configuration,JDBC "
