"For more information, see the link:https://docs.oracle.com/en/database/"
"oracle/oracle-database/21/jjdbc/data-sources-and-URLs.html#GUID-AEA8E228-"
"1B21-4111-AF4C-B1F33744CA08[official documentation]."
msgstr ""

